    "status": "present",
    "value": "With the same per-worker slices, return the median of all values. If the total count is odd it is the middle value; if even it is the average of the two middle values, which is an integer when that average is exact and otherwise ends in .5. The candidate simulates a coordinator that binary-searches over the value range and asks each worker how many of its values are at most the probe."
  },
